NFORMATION WILL IMPACT ONGOING WORK TO IMPROVE DECISION-MAKING. SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH. CENTRALIZED COLLABORATION AND DATA MANAGEMENT ON A COMMON DATA PLATFORM REMOVES SILOS AND KEEPS TEAMS ON THE SAME PAGE WITH THE MOST UP TO DATE INFORMATION. EASY TEAM HANDOFF. FAST ADOPTION FROM ONE TEAM TO THE NEXT, ACCESSIBLE HISTORICAL DATA, AND COLLABORATION AND DATA MANAGEMENT IN THE FIELD WITH MOBILE CONNECTIVITY. SAVE ON IT MAINTENANCE AND BENEFIT FROM THE CLOUD. SCALE UP AND DOWN AS PROJECT NEEDS CHANGE. NO MORE WASTING TIME ON UPLOADS, DOWNLOADS, OR COSTLY SERVER MAINTENANCE."}